00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.160
They had built a really
fast performance solution

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:35.162
that was really baked into the
Google stuff, as we assume.

00:02:35.162 --> 00:02:36.620
And so what we
wanted to do was, we

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:40.040
